  "welcome.kqirat_title": "Built for the Kuwaiti Gold Standard",
  "welcome.kqirat_desc": "KuwaitQumash is a specialized ecosystem designed to meet the strict demands of Kuwait's luxury jewelry industry. From automated Civil ID customer registrations to live feeds directly integrated with the official Kuwait Gold Market, we ensure your store remains fully compliant, secure, and ready for high-volume transactions.",
