  "welcome.faq.title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "welcome.faq.subtitle": "Find answers to common questions about KuwaitQumash.",
  "welcome.faq.q1": "How does the live gold price calculation work?",
  "welcome.faq.a1": "KuwaitQumash syncs directly with the Kuwait Gold Market in real-time. When creating an invoice, the system automatically fetches the latest live price for 24K, 22K, 21K, and 18K gold to calculate the exact item value instantly.",
  "welcome.faq.q2": "Can I manage multiple branches from a single dashboard?",
  "welcome.faq.a2": "Yes. The Store Owner dashboard allows you to monitor and manage all branches, analyze branch-specific sales trends, allocate inventory, and view aggregate store metrics in one central location.",
  "welcome.faq.q3": "Is my store's data secure?",
  "welcome.faq.a3": "Absolutely. All data is encrypted during transmission and stored securely in Google Cloud. We run automated, continuous backups to ensure your business information is never lost.",
  "welcome.faq.q4": "Does the app support barcode printing and scanning?",
  "welcome.faq.a4": "Yes. You can generate and print professional barcodes for all items. Staff can scan barcodes using standard usb scanners or directly using the device camera for fast checkouts.",
